hadiths[12]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1085","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rafi bin Khadij aur Sahl bin Abi Hathma se Bushair bin Yasar maula Ansar ke hawale se riwayat hai ke un dono ne unhe bayan kiya: Beshak Abdullah bin Sahl aur Muhayyisa bin Mas'ud Khaibar aaye. Phir khajooron mein juda ho gaye. Phir Abdullah bin Sahl qatl kiye gaye. Phir Abd al-Rahman bin Sahl, Huwayyisa aur Muhayyisa bane Mas'ud Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye. Phir unhon ne apne sathi ke mamle mein baat ki. Phir Abd al-Rahman ne ibtida ki, jabke wo qaum mein sab se chhote they. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Bade ki badayi karo [Yahya ne kaha, sanad ke ek rawi: Taake bada baat kare]. Phir unhon ne apne sathi ke mamle mein baat ki. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum apne maqtool, ya farmaya apne sathi ke mustahiq hoge, tum mein se pachaas ki qasmon se? Unhon ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Aisa mamla jo hum ne nahi dekha. Aap ne farmaya: Phir tumhe Yahood bari karein un mein se pachaas ki qasmon mein? Unhon ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Kafir qaum hain. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe apni taraf se fidya diya. Sahl ne kaha: Phir main ne un oonton mein se oontni payi. Phir wo un ke sathane mein dakhil hui aur mujhe apne paon se mara."
"1086","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Ukl mein se aath afrad Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye. Phir unhon ne Aap se Islam par bai'at ki. Phir unhe zameen na-muwafiq hui aur un ke jism beemar ho gaye. Phir unhon ne is ki Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se shikayat ki. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum hamare charwahe ke sath us ke oonton mein nahi nikalte? Phir un ke doodh aur peshab mein se paoge? Unhon ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Phir wo nikle aur un ke doodh aur peshab mein se piya. Phir sehat-mand ho gaye. Phir unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke charwahe ko qatl kiya aur maweshiyon ko hank le gaye. Phir ye Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko pahuncha. Phir Aap ne un ke peechhe bheja. Phir wo paye gaye aur laye gaye. Phir Aap ne un ka hukm diya. Phir un ke hath aur paon kaate gaye, un ki aankhein garam salai se phodi gayein. Phir unhe dhoop mein phenka gaya yahan tak ke wo mar gaye."
"1087","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamane mein ek Yahoodi ne ek londi par hamla kiya. Phir us se chandi ke zewar liye jo us par they, aur us ka sar kuchal diya. Phir us ke ghar wale use Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas laye jabke wo aakhri saans mein thi, aur wo bol na sakti thi. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se farmaya: Tumhe kis ne qatl kiya? Falan, jo use qatl karne wala na tha. Phir us ne apne sar se ishara kiya ke nahi. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Aap ne us ke qatil ke siwa doosre mard se farmaya. Phir us ne ishara kiya ke nahi. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Phir falan, us ke qatil ke liye. Phir us ne ishara kiya ke haan. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ka hukm diya. Phir us ka sar do patharon ke darmiyan kuchla gaya."
"1088","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ne doosre ke hath ko kaata. Phir us ne apna hath us ke munh se kheencha. Phir us ke dono samne ke daant gir gaye. Phir wo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas jhagadne aaye. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se ek apne bhai ko kaat-ta hai jaise saannd kaat-ta hai. Tumhare liye diyat nahi."
"1089","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ya'la bin Umayya (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath tangi wale lashkar mein ladayi ki. Phir wo mere nazdeek mere sab se mazboot amal mein se tha. Phir mera ek mazdoor tha. Phir us ne ek insan se ladayi ki. Phir un mein se ek ne apne sathi ki ungli kaati. Phir us ne apni ungli kheenchi. Phir us ka daant gir gaya aur toot gaya. Phir wo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas gaya. Phir Aap ne us ke daant ko zaya farmaya. Aur farmaya: Kya wo apni ungli tumhare munh mein chhore ke tum use kaato? Mera khayal hai Aap ne farmaya: Jaise saannd kaat-ta hai."
"1090","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rubayyi ne, jo Anas bin Malik ki phuphi hain, Ansar ki ek londi ka samne ka daant toda. Phir qaum ne qisas manga. Phir wo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne qisas ka hukm farmaya. Phir Anas bin al-Nadr ne, jo Anas bin Malik ke chacha hain, kaha: Nahi, Allah ki qasam! Us ka daant nahi toda jayega Ya Rasulullah! Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ae Anas! Allah ki kitab qisas hai. Phir qaum raazi ho gayi aur diyat qubool ki. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ke bandon mein se jo Allah par qasam khaye to Wo use poora kare."
"1091","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Musalman shakhs ka khoon jo gawahi deta hai ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur main Allah ka Rasool hun, halal nahi magar teen mein se ek se: Jaan ke badle jaan, shadi-shuda zaniya, aur deen se nikalne wala jamaat chhorne wala."
"1092","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Koi jaan zulm se qatl nahi ki jati magar Ibn Adam Awwal par us ke khoon mein se hissa hai. Kyunke wo pehla hai jis ne qatl ki sunnat dali."
"1093","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Sab se pehle logon ke darmiyan khoonon ka faisla kiya jayega."
"1094","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakrah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Zamana ghoom gaya hai us haalat jaisa jis din Allah ne aasman aur zameen paida kiye. Saal barah mahine hain. Un mein chaar hurmat wale hain: Teen musalsal: Dhu al-Qa'da, Dhu al-Hijja aur Muharram, aur Rajab Muzar, jo Jumada aur Sha'ban ke darmiyan hai. Ye kaun sa mahina hai? Hum ne arz kiya: Allah aur Us ke Rasool zyada jante hain. Phir Aap khamosh rahe yahan tak ke hum ne gumaan kiya ke Aap use us ke naam ke siwa naam se pukarege. Aap ne farmaya: Kya Dhu al-Hijja nahi? Hum ne arz kiya: Kyun nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Phir ye kaun sa sheher hai? Hum ne arz kiya: Allah aur Us ke Rasool zyada jante hain. Phir Aap khamosh rahe yahan tak ke hum ne gumaan kiya ke Aap use us ke naam ke siwa naam se pukarege. Aap ne farmaya: Kya Balda nahi? Hum ne arz kiya: Kyun nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Phir ye kaun sa din hai? Hum ne arz kiya: Allah aur Us ke Rasool zyada jante hain. Phir Aap khamosh rahe yahan tak ke hum ne gumaan kiya ke Aap use us ke naam ke siwa naam se pukarege. Aap ne farmaya: Kya Nahr ka din nahi? Hum ne arz kiya: Kyun nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Phir beshak tumhare khoon aur maal [Muhammad ne kaha, sanad ke ek rawi: Aur mera khayal hai Aap ne kaha: Aur tumhari izzatein] tum par haram hain jaise tumhare is din ki hurmat tumhare is sheher mein tumhare is mahine mein. Aur tum anqareeb apne Rab se miloge. Phir Wo tum se tumhare aamal ke bare mein poochhega. Suno! Mere baad gumrah ho kar na lautna ke tum mein se ek doosre ki gardanein mare. Suno! Hazir ghayab ko pahunchaye. Shayad jisے pahunchaya jaye wo us se zyada yaad rakhne wala ho jis ne suna. Phir Muhammad jab use zikr karte to kehte: Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne sach farmaya. Phir farmaya: Suno! Kya main ne pahunchaya? Do martaba."
"1095","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Hudhail ki do aurton mein faisla farmaya jo ladein. Phir un mein se ek ne doosri ko pathar mara. Phir us ke pet mein laga jabke wo hamla se thi. Phir us ke pet mein jo beta tha use qatl kar diya. Phir wo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas jhagadne aaye. Phir Aap ne faisla farmaya ke us ke pet mein jo hai us ki diyat ghura hai: Ghulam ya londi. Phir us aurat ke wali ne kaha jis par jurmana hua: Main kaise jurmana dun, Ya Rasulullah! Jo na piya, na khaya, na bola, na roya? Phir is jaisa baatil hai. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ye to kahinon ke bhaiyon mein se hai."
"1096","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mughira bin Shu'ba aur Muhammad bin Maslama se Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ke hawale se riwayat hai ke unhon ne un se aurat ke hamal girane ke bare mein mashwara kiya. To Mughira ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ghura ka faisla farmaya: Ghulam ya londi. Phir Muhammad bin Maslama ne gawahi di ke unhon ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko is ka faisla farmate dekha."
